// G1 pivotal acceptance pipeline (docs/vm-workspace-spec.md §Empirical pivot).
// Run inside a vm-runner VM, its tool steps prove the guest-local work surface
// fixes the exact failure surfaces that motivated the pivot:
//
//   deps — `pnpm install` with a workspace-local store, so the store's SQLite
//          `index.db` lands on the WORK SURFACE. Over virtiofs this died with
//          `[ERR_SQLITE_ERROR] disk I/O error`; on the guest's ext4 /work it
//          must succeed.
//   lint — `pnpm run lint` (Nx), so Nx's SQLite task DB is opened on /work.
//          Nx over virtiofs died with `SqliteFailure(SystemIoFailure, 5386)`;
//          on ext4 it must succeed. Second, independent SQLite surface.
//   vcs  — in-guest `jj describe`/`status`, run in /work. The copied
//          `.jj/repo` still resolves to the /mnt/repo store mount and writes
//          to the shared HOST store, so the marker is visible in the host
//          repo's `jj log` with no export step (W2, unchanged by G1).
//
// All steps run in the pipeline cwd (/work) — NOT /mnt/workspace, which is a
// ro transport the runner copied here. Deterministic tool nodes
// (shape=parallelogram) — no LLM backend needed.

digraph vm_workspace_acceptance {
    goal = "prove pnpm + Nx (SQLite) work on the guest-local ext4 work surface"

    start [shape=Mdiamond]
    deps  [shape=parallelogram,
           tool_command="pnpm install --store-dir .pnpm-store"]
    lint  [shape=parallelogram,
           tool_command="pnpm run lint"]
    vcs   [shape=parallelogram,
           tool_command="jj describe -m 'vm-workspace-acceptance ran' && jj status"]
    done  [shape=Msquare]

    start -> deps
    deps -> lint  [condition="outcome=success"]
    lint -> vcs   [condition="outcome=success"]
    vcs -> done   [condition="outcome=success"]
}
